# ALLOWLIST build context (#202): the image is a public distribution, and a
# dev tree's root holds .membrane/ (the field, audit logs, serve-auth.json),
# field dumps and logs. Exclude everything, then re-include only what
# `pip install .` and the entrypoint need. Add a path here only if the image
# truly needs it -- never a root wildcard.
*
!pyproject.toml
!setup.py
!native/**
!README.md
!LICENSE
!membrane/**
!docker/**
# never ship bytecode caches from a dev tree
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# the engine's local build outputs: Rust's target dir and an extension built on the dev machine (wrong platform)
native/target
membrane/*.so
